error[DZ0507]: `bump` needs a mutable receiver
   ┌─ typeerrors/src/errors.dz:75:5
   │
75 │     c.bump()
   │     ^ this is not mutable
   │
   = help: `mut fn` methods take `&mut self` — bind with `let mut`, or take `&mut` here (spec §7.3)

error[DZ0507]: cannot assign to `total`
